        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I’ll use inclusion–exclusion with binary search to handle large values of `k`. I also noticed a supplied test that appears inconsistent with the specification: it includes denomination `1` but expects `k + 1`. I’ll check that after implementing the function.",
          "annotations": [],
